# ex29 — spiral assignment fixture (mirrors demos/6-space/29-spiral-assign.bqn)
# 8 demo entities (5 coins at rows 0 2 3 5 7) plus row 8: the Player anchor holding the
# .bqn's external playerPos 100 200. polar is dyadic r Polar¨ theta, theta in degrees.
n 9
col coin bool 1 0 1 1 0 1 0 1 0
col pos vec 0 0 | 10 10 | 0 0 | 0 0 | 20 20 | 0 0 | 30 30 | 0 0 | 100 200
bind player entity 8
fn polar {𝕨×(•math.Cos 𝕩×π÷180)⋈•math.Sin 𝕩×π÷180}
ja 硬貨 coin
ja 位置 pos
ja 勇者 player
